    "OK": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "好"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On iOS, an app that reads the clipboard is either blocked (background reads) or triggers an “Allow Paste” prompt first (foreground reads). So “copy it and it's already clean” can't be done on this platform — that's a system limitation, not a shortcut this app is taking.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iOS 上 App 读剪贴板，要么被系统拦住（后台静默读），要么会先弹一次「允许粘贴」（前台读）。所以「复制即自动清洗」在这个平台上做不到，这不是本 App 的实现问题。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open LinkPure…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
