      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "搜索我的规则"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set its URL parameter to the output of step 1 (tap the parameter → choose “Clipboard”)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "把它的 URL 参数设成上一步的输出（点参数 → 选「剪贴板」）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set up (once)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设置（只需一次）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Settings → Accessibility → Touch → Back Tap → pick this shortcut": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设置 → 辅助功能 → 触控 → 轻点背面 → 选这条快捷指令"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Settings…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设置…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Siri": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Siri"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Status": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "状态"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stays quietly in the menu bar after login. No window is shown.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "登录后静默驻留在菜单栏，不会弹出窗口。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Swipe down → “+” in the top left → Add a Control → search for “Shortcuts”, then pick this one": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下滑 → 左上角 + → 添加控制 → 搜「快捷指令」，添加后会让你挑是哪一条"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Test URL (optional)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "测试 URL（可选）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The URL text to clean": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "要清洗的 URL 文本"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The engine matches on regexFilter, then replaces the whole URL using regexSubstitution ($1..$9 are supported). A rule with an empty replacement is invalid, and Save stays disabled.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "引擎按 regexFilter 匹配，再用 regexSubstitution 替换整个 URL（支持 $1..$9）。留空替换则规则无效，保存按钮会保持禁用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The flow:": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "流程："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The important part: the clipboard is read by the **system**, not by this app — so iOS never shows an “Allow Paste” prompt.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关键点：读剪贴板的是**系统**，不是本 App——因此不会弹出「允许粘贴」提示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The macOS version isn't affected: copy a link and it's rewritten automatically, with nothing to press.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "桌面版（macOS）不受此限制，复制链接即自动清洗，无需任何操作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The rule library is empty": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "规则库为空"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The test runs your draft through the whole rule set, so what you see is what a saved rule would actually do.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "测试会连同其他已生效的规则一起跑完整改写链，与保存后的真实行为一致。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There's exactly one thing to get right: “Copy to Clipboard” must be **inside** the “If”. Put it outside and every run writes the clipboard again even when nothing changed — iOS doesn't de-duplicate clipboard writes, so you'd trigger a Universal Clipboard sync for nothing, and any rich text you copied gets flattened to plain text (non-text content may be dropped entirely). Clean URL Text itself has no side effects; all the risk lives in where that write-back sits.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只有一条规则：「拷贝到剪贴板」必须在「如果」**里面**。放到外面，结果没变时也会照写一遍剪贴板——iOS 写剪贴板**没有内容去重**，于是白触发一次 Universal Clipboard 同步，还会把复制来的富文本压成纯文本（非文本内容更糟，可能直接被清掉）。`Clean URL Text` 本身没有副作用，风险全部来自这个写回动作放在哪。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
